/* j0(x), y0(x)
 * Bessel function of the first and second kinds of order zero.
 * Method -- j0(x):
 *      1. For tiny x, we use j0(x) = 1 - x^2/4 + x^4/64 - ...
 *      2. Reduce x to |x| since j0(x)=j0(-x),  and
 *         for x in (0,2)
