 *         where x0 = x-pi/4. It is better to compute sin(x0),cos(x0)
 *         as follow:
 *              cos(x0) = cos(x)cos(pi/4)+sin(x)sin(pi/4)
 *                      = 1/sqrt(2) * (cos(x) + sin(x))
 *              sin(x0) = sin(x)cos(pi/4)-cos(x)sin(pi/4)
